         <combo attributeName="midimap" selection="live"/>
      </attribs>
      <object id="patch/object" uuid="9007833b-067d-5007-a937-764411d3d722">
         <sDescription>Gills front panel for the Chroma-Console-style patch: module buttons, SHIFT layer, module order, tap, capture, gesture recording, OLED and LEDs. MIDI: the CC chart of the pedal (16-19, 64-84, 91, 93, 103-106) plus CC20-23 module effect, CC24-27 module bypass, CC28 order; midimap live: CC64 capture, CC80 bypass, CC82 tap; midimap pedal: those three as on the pedal. midich: MIDI channel (omni = all). clock: slave = RATE and TIME follow MIDI clock with note divisions, LFO locked to the beat.</sDescription>
         <author>Claude for Ksoloti Gills</author>
         <license>BSD</license>
         <inlets>
            <frac32.positive name="p1" description="pot 1"/>
            <frac32.positive name="p2" description="pot 2"/>
